circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"83.12819672131147\" cy=\"167.18032786885246\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 12%&amp;#10;It rained 56% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 72 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"99.84083333333334\" cy=\"179.77777777777777\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 19%&amp;#10;It rained 54% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 59 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"123.69999999999999\" cy=\"184.5762711864407\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 27%&amp;#10;It rained 73% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 71 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"152.632676056338\" cy=\"115.40845070422534\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 36%&amp;#10;It rained 73% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 60 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"185.73500000000004\" cy=\"115.06666666666666\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 51%&amp;#10;It rained 79% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 68 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"239.89352941176475\" cy=\"92.94117647058823\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 71%&amp;#10;It rained 81% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 63 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"310.12666666666667\" cy=\"87.33333333333331\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 93%&amp;#10;It rained 92% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 66 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"387.5954545454546\" cy=\"45.575757575757564\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(65%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Roseau the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>winter</b> (-0.22) and least in\n<b>summer</b> (-1.26).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>166</td><td class='num'>77%</td><td class='num'>-1.265</td><td class='num'>47.9%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>166</td><td class='num'>63%</td><td class='num'>-0.315</td><td class='num'>25.0%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>142</td><td class='num'>55%</td><td class='num'>-0.235</td><td class='num'>27.0%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>162</td><td class='num'>64%</td><td class='num'>-0.223</td><td class='num'>32.5%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":15.30174,"lon":-61.38808,"n":636,"n_cities":213,"name":"Roseau","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.02,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.0,"n":37,"obs":0.21621621621621623,"sig":true},{"hi":0.06,"lo":0.02,"mean":0.02772151898734177,"n":79,"obs":0.45569620253164556,"sig"